| quote = I write a lot of it in my car, that's just a very inspiring place to listen to music. I think it puts me in the zone. I just think of melodies usually and then lyrics come after. Sometimes really easily, and then sometimes I'll have a melody for a week before I come up with any lyrics so it just kind of depends.
| author = Tinashe
| source = speaking on her writing style in 2013<ref name="Vice.com">{{cite magazine |url=https://www.vice.com/en/article/tinashe-black-water-interview/ |title=Tinashe: Are You Ready? |last=Nostro |first=Lauren |magazine=[[Vice (magazine)|Vice]] |date=December 6, 2013 |access-date=April 13, 2016 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160304085229/http://noisey.vice.com/es/blog/tinashe-black-water-interview |archive-date=March 4, 2016 |url-status=live}}</ref>
